# Feature Planning With Code Map

Canonical rules: `AGENTS.md` in this repo plus `plan-product:using-code-map`.

When planning, use the task or feature guide first. When maps help, check `node "<PLUGIN_ROOT>/scripts/map-code/check-freshness.mjs"`, then read the minimum relevant module context or use a bounded map query. Regenerate stale maps with `npm run map-code` if configured, or `node "<PLUGIN_ROOT>/scripts/map-code/generate.mjs"`. Targeted source search and reading remain sufficient evidence.
